        <mxCell id="fjiv74B2g2Rp5R7PVZmW-7" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;gradientColor=#97d077;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;MVP Tahap 2: Core Fitur Kelola Data Produk (Admin)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,2,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Mengikuti alur kelola produk, Admin bisa mengakses menu produk, melihat data dari database, serta melakukan penambahan atau pembaruan data secara valid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,2,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,2,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="490" x="180" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fjiv74B2g2Rp5R7PVZmW-12" edge="1" parent="1" source="fjiv74B2g2Rp5R7PVZmW-9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" target="fjiv74B2g2Rp5R7PVZmW-11">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fjiv74B2g2Rp5R7PVZmW-9" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;gradientColor=#97d077;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;MVP Tahap 3: Core Fitur Utama Transaksi Penjualan (Kasir)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,2,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Ini inti dari aplikasi kasirnya. Berdasarkan diagram transaksi, alurnya mencakup input barcode produk, perhitungan total belanja otomatis, penginputan uang bayar, validasi kecukupan uang, pemotongan stok di database, hingga pencetakan struk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,2,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,2,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="490" x="180" y="450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fjiv74B2g2Rp5R7PVZmW-11" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;gradientColor=#97d077;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rilis Akhir: Polish UI &amp;amp; Integrasi Desain&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,1,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Setelah seluruh logika backend dan alurnya &lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,1,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;43&quot;&gt;working end-to-end&lt;/i&gt; dari awal sampai akhir&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,1,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,1,0,0,2&quot;&gt;, barulah tahap akhir difokuskan pada penyempurnaan tampilan antarmuka dan integrasi desain Figma bersama anggota tim.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="490" x="180" y="600" as="geometry" />
