        <mxCell id="fjiv74B2g2Rp5R7PVZmW-14" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;gradientColor=#ea6b66;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Tahap 1 Langsung Bikin UI Cantik&lt;/b&gt;: Hanya fokus mempercantik tampilan antarmuka (UI) dan tombol-tombol yang mati tanpa menyambungkannya ke database&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
